\title{Compare one gene's expression in a TCGA project's baseline tumors with its adjacent normal tissue and the...}
\description{Compare one gene's expression in a TCGA project's baseline tumors with its adjacent normal tissue and the GTEx normal reference, exactly as GeneFox's Tumor vs Normal screen does (numbers, p-values in display.table, figure, per-participant CSV). geometry=paired_slope draws only matched adjacent-normal patients, with the app's paired n and Wilcoxon signed-rank test; with geometry omitted, the figure is the paired slope when the cohort has paired patients, otherwise the box plot, as on the screen. Latency: 10-60 s cold, seconds when cached. The figure is the app's TCGA › Tumor vs Normal PNG export.}
